{"id":3291,"slug":"3291-helmet-cors-rate-limiting-security-hardening-cho-nestjs-api","category":"NestJS","subcategory":"Auth & Security","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Helmet, CORS, Rate Limiting — security hardening cho NestJS API?","question_en":"Helmet, CORS, Rate Limiting — security hardening for NestJS APIs?","answer_vi":"**Helmet**: HTTP security headers middleware — ngăn chặn XSS, clickjacking, sniffing:\n```typescript\nimport helmet from 'helmet';\napp.use(helmet()); // Thêm vào main.ts\n```\n\n**CORS**: chỉ allow origins cụ thể:\n```typescript\napp.enableCors({\n  origin: ['https://yourdomain.com'],\n  credentials: true,\n  methods: ['GET', 'POST', 'PUT', 'DELETE'],\n});\n```\n\n**Rate Limiting** với `@nestjs/throttler`:\n```typescript\nThrottlerModule.forRoot([\n  { name: 'short', ttl: 1000, limit: 3 },     // 3 req/s\n  { name: 'medium', ttl: 10000, limit: 20 },  // 20 req/10s\n  { name: 'long', ttl: 60000, limit: 100 },   // 100 req/min\n])\n```\n\n**Input sanitization**: `class-validator` + `ValidationPipe` với `whitelist: true` ngăn chặn mass assignment. Dùng `sanitize-html` cho user-generated content. **SQL Injection**: TypeORM parameterized queries tự động escape — không bao giờ dùng raw string interpolation trong queries.","answer_en":"**Helmet**: HTTP security-header middleware — blocks XSS, clickjacking and MIME sniffing:\n```typescript\nimport helmet from 'helmet';\napp.use(helmet()); // add in main.ts\n```\n\n**CORS**: allow specific origins only:\n```typescript\napp.enableCors({\n  origin: ['https://yourdomain.com'],\n  credentials: true,\n  methods: ['GET', 'POST', 'PUT', 'DELETE'],\n});\n```\n\n**Rate limiting** with `@nestjs/throttler`:\n```typescript\nThrottlerModule.forRoot([\n  { name: 'short', ttl: 1000, limit: 3 },     // 3 req/s\n  { name: 'medium', ttl: 10000, limit: 20 },  // 20 req/10s\n  { name: 'long', ttl: 60000, limit: 100 },   // 100 req/min\n])\n```\n\n**Input sanitization**: `class-validator` + `ValidationPipe` with `whitelist: true` blocks mass assignment. Use `sanitize-html` for user-generated content. **SQL injection**: TypeORM parameterized queries escape automatically — never interpolate raw strings into queries.","answer_html_vi":"<p><strong>Helmet</strong>: HTTP security headers middleware — ngăn chặn XSS, clickjacking, sniffing:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import helmet from 'helmet';\napp.use(helmet()); // Thêm vào main.ts\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> helmet <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;helmet&#x27;</span>;\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">helmet</span>()); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Thêm vào main.ts</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>CORS</strong>: chỉ allow origins cụ thể:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"app.enableCors({\n  origin: ['https://yourdomain.com'],\n  credentials: true,\n  methods: ['GET', 'POST', 'PUT', 'DELETE'],\n});\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">enableCors</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">origin</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://yourdomain.com&#x27;</span>],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">credentials</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">methods</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;PUT&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;DELETE&#x27;</span>],\n});</code></pre></div><p><strong>Rate Limiting</strong> với <code>@nestjs/throttler</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"ThrottlerModule.forRoot([\n  { name: 'short', ttl: 1000, limit: 3 },     // 3 req/s\n  { name: 'medium', ttl: 10000, limit: 20 },  // 20 req/10s\n  { name: 'long', ttl: 60000, limit: 100 },   // 100 req/min\n])\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ThrottlerModule</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forRoot</span>([\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;short&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ttl</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1000</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">limit</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span> },     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 3 req/s</span>\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;medium&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ttl</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">10000</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">limit</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">20</span> },  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 20 req/10s</span>\n  { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;long&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ttl</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">60000</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">limit</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">100</span> },   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 100 req/min</span>\n])</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Input sanitization</strong>: <code>class-validator</code> + <code>ValidationPipe</code> với <code>whitelist: true</code> ngăn chặn mass assignment.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Dùng <code>sanitize-html</code> cho user-generated content. <strong>SQL Injection</strong>: TypeORM parameterized queries tự động escape — không bao giờ dùng raw string interpolation trong queries.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><strong>Helmet</strong>: HTTP security-header middleware — blocks XSS, clickjacking and MIME sniffing:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import helmet from 'helmet';\napp.use(helmet()); // add in main.ts\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> helmet <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;helmet&#x27;</span>;\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">helmet</span>()); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// add in main.ts</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>CORS</strong>: allow specific origins only:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"app.enableCors({\n  origin: ['https://yourdomain.com'],\n  credentials: true,\n  methods: ['GET', 'POST', 'PUT', 'DELETE'],\n});\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" 